0..76 Comment "//! The declarations that the sources of the exact reals subject share. Each"
77..124 Comment "//! source that reads them imports this source."
125..128 Comment "//!"
129..206 Comment "//! No two sources of one subject declare one name. So a declaration that two"
207..243 Comment "//! exemplars read lives here, once."
244..247 Comment "//!"
248..318 Comment "//! A source hands the host a plan as its canonical bytes in lowercase"
319..393 Comment "//! hexadecimal, and the host replies a plan that the run holds. `decided`"
394..467 Comment "//! runs a machine on the open root of a plan, and `enclosed` asks for an"
468..499 Comment "//! enclosure of its real root."
500..503 Comment "//!"
504..582 Comment "//! - see: `crates/surface-dispatcher/src/evaluate/reals.rs` — the host that"
583..609 Comment "//!   serves the interface"
610..689 Comment "//! - see: `crates/surface-dispatcher/tests/corpus.rs` — the rule of one name"
690..712 Comment "//!   for each subject"
